{"type":"after","callId":"call@1415","endTime":324743.903,"result":{"value":"FacultyLens\n\nOVERVIEW\n\nDashboard\nAnalytics\nReports\n\nTEACHING\n\nCourses\nAssessments\nQuestion Bank\nHistory\n\nAI TOOLS\n\nAnalysis\nAI\nQuestion Generator\nAI\nDocument Chat\nAI\nAI Evaluation\nAI\n\nWORKSPACE\n\nCollaboration\nNotifications\nFeedback\nSettings\nD\nDr. E2E Faculty\nAssistant Professor\nSite\nSign out\nAcademic Analytics\nD\nDr. E2E Faculty\nAcademic Analytics\n\nLast calculated just now.\n\nPDF\nCSV\nRefresh\nCOURSE\nAll Courses\nASSESSMENT\nAll Assessments\nSEMESTER\nAll Semesters\nACADEMIC YEAR\nAll Years\nASSESSMENT TYPE\nAll Types\nSTART\nEND\nReset\nApply Filters\nCOURSES\n0\nASSESSMENTS\n0\nQUESTIONS\n0\nAVG QUALITY\nN/A\n0 analyzed\nSTUDENT PERFORMANCE\nN/A\nNo finalized grades\nCO COVERAGE\nN/A\n0/0 outcomes\nOPEN GAPS\nN/A\n0 performance analyses\nAI ANALYSIS RUNS\n0\ncurrent completed analyses\n\nAnalytics are evidence, trends and signals for faculty review. FacultyLens never changes assessments, grades, mappings, rubrics or AI models automatically.\n\nNo assessment data available.\n\nCreate and analyze an assessment to see academic quality analytics here.\n\nAreas Needing Attention\n\nPrioritised signals from existing analyses — not automatic decisions.\n\nNo attention signals\n\nNothing in the current scope crosses the configured gap, quality, coverage or similarity thresholds.\n\nAssessment Quality Trend\n7D\n30D\n3M\n6M\n1Y\nALL\n\nNo quality trend yet\n\nQuality scores appear here after assessments are analyzed.\n\nDifficulty Distribution\n\nNo questions in scope\n\nAdd questions to an assessment to see the difficulty profile.\n\nAssessment Quality\n\nNo assessment data available.\n\nCreate and analyze an assessment to see academic quality analytics here.\n\nCognitive Level Distribution\n\nNo questions in scope\n\nAdd questions to an assessment to see the Bloom profile.\n\nLearning Outcome Coverage\n\nNo learning outcomes defined\n\nAdd course outcomes and run an assessment analysis to see coverage.\n\nProgram Outcome Coverage\n\nPO analysis is not configured for this course.\n\nLink the course to a program and map course outcomes to program outcomes (CO/PO mapping) to see PO coverage.\n\nStudent Performance\n\nNo finalized grades are available yet.\n\nPerformance analytics will appear after faculty grades are finalized.\n\nStudent Performance Trend\n7D\n30D\n3M\n6M\n1Y\nALL\n\nNo performance trend yet\n\nRun a student performance analysis on graded assessments to see the trend.\n\nLearning Gaps\n\nNo performance analysis yet\n\nLearning gaps appear after a student performance analysis has been run.\n\nTopic Performance\n\nFinalized grades aggregated by detected topic (response-weighted).\n\nNo topic-level performance\n\nTopics appear after question analysis and a student performance analysis have been run.\n\nQuestion Performance\nSort\nWorst performance\nHighest gap\nQuestion number\nTopic\nCO\n\nNo question-level performance\n\nQuestion performance appears after a student performance analysis has been run.\n\nCompare Assessments\n\nSelect two or more assessments in scope.\n\nCompare\n\nNo assessments in scope\n\nAdjust the filters to include assessments.\n\nAssessments in Scope\n\nNo assessments in scope\n\nAdjust the filters or create an assessment.\n\nQuestion Similarity\n\nNo similarity analysis yet\n\nSimilarity categories appear after an assessment analysis has compared questions with the question bank.\n\nQuestion Bank\nBank questions\n0\nAssessment questions\n0\nBank questions matched\n0\nPotential duplicate / highly similar\nQuestions without CO\n0\nRubrics\n\nNo rubrics yet\n\nGenerate or create rubrics for assessment questions to see rubric activity.\n\nAI Grading Assistance\n\nNo AI-assisted grading yet\n\nRequest AI grading assistance on student answers to see suggestion vs final-grade analytics.\n\nInter-Grader Consistency\n\nFacultyLens Agreement Indicator\n\nNot available\n\nInter-grader cons